cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "White-Box Scorers for Uncertainty Quantification and Hallucination Detection in Large Language Models"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-03-09

authors:
  - family-names: "Wild"
    given-names: "Niklas"

abstract: >
  Reproducible research artifact for a master's thesis on white-box scoring methods
  for hallucination detection and uncertainty-related ranking in large language models.
  The repository contains two experimental phases: (1) controlled replication on TruthfulQA
  and (2) transfer evaluation on constrained medical QA (MedQA, PubMedQA), including
  frozen artifacts, manifests, and analysis scripts.

keywords:
  - hallucination detection
  - uncertainty quantification
  - large language models
  - truthfulqa
  - medqa
  - pubmedqa
  - reproducibility

license: CC-BY-NC-4.0

url: https://github.com/nklswld/uqlm_white_box_scorer